post_install() {
    cat <<'MSG'
==> AI Subscription Usage feed is installed. Next steps:
    1. Claude Code: set its status line command to  ai-usage-claude-statusline
       (see usage/README.md in the repo for the exact settings snippet).
    2. Turn on "Show usage bars" under "AI subscription usage" in the
       Cyberpunk Wallpaper settings for the screen you want them on.
MSG
}
